{"id":"n26006-1-7","stage":3,"title":"줄곧 · 一直","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26006-1-7-1","ko":"아까부터 줄곧 대문 쪽을 보고 있던데 무슨 일 있니?","zh":"从刚才开始你就一直盯着大门看，出什么事了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까부터","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄곧","meaning":"一直","explanation":"줄곧：一直","readings":[{"term":"줄곧","audio":"/audio/86cbff9f318271d93dc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26006","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대문","meaning":"大门","explanation":"대문：大门","readings":[{"term":"대문","audio":"/audio/ade1526c0cab5d44f2d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57955","senseId":"1","lemma":"대문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쪽을","meaning":"边","explanation":"쪽：边；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던데","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"有，起","explanation":"있다：有，起；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"15","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"86cbff9f318271d9","term":"줄곧","zh":"一直","audio":"/audio/86cbff9f318271d93dc9.mp3","entryId":"26006","definition":"持续不断地。","pronunciation":["줄곧"]},{"id":"ade1526c0cab5d44","term":"대문","zh":"大门","audio":"/audio/ade1526c0cab5d44f2d1.mp3","entryId":"57955","definition":"主要在房子的前面，供人们进出的大的门。","pronunciation":["대ː문"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；有，起","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0a8366303f7a530bf36.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26006-1-7-2","ko":"응. 할머니께서 우리 집에 오신다고 하셨거든.","zh":"嗯。奶奶说她要来我们家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI