:"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46985f17de8c0a05f937.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.177,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26006","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.6537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。奶奶说她要来我们家。","已经过了一天，工作居然还有半部分没做？","从刚才开始你就一直盯着大门看，出什么事了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。奶奶说她要来我们家。","从刚才开始你就一直盯着大门看，出什么事了吗？","已经过了一天，工作居然还有半部分没做？"],"answer":0}]}
